  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 学问道理小红书都有，发财上上签到底哪里求？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1bdfe5ac7bdb080c3383fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1bdfe5ac7bdb080c3383fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 08:18:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期简介：</span></strong><br><span>【突如其来的更新】立春一过（大家可以推算是多久录的节目了），又到了大家想“算一算”的时候了。这一期，我们凑齐了三个主播+两个嘉宾，从东方的周易八卦、八字命理，聊到西方的星座、星宿、塔罗牌，再聊到这两年火遍全球的赛博玄学——MBTI。</span></p><p><span>算命师傅的价格也会随市场浮动？读博选老板，先和老板合个八字？为什么说塔罗牌店的“主要创收”是卖水晶？以及，当我们沉迷于这些工具时，我们到底在寻求什么？</span></p><p><span>本期既是玄学大百科，也是关于焦虑、心理暗示和“理性玄学”的深度闲聊。</span><strong><span>温馨提示：内容纯属娱乐，拒绝封建迷信，自己的人生剧本自己写。</span></strong></p><hr><h3><strong><span>🎧 时间轴 &amp; 精彩看点</span></strong></h3><h4><strong><span>Part 0：开场 &amp; 那些年花过的“算命钱”</span></strong></h4><h4><strong><span>Part 1：东方智慧 - 周易与八字</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>橙子大王入坑契机：</span></strong><span> 论文被导师质疑代写，绝望中开始研究八字。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>算命的两大实用功能：</span></strong></p><ol><li><p><span>只信好的，不好的就算他算错了。</span></p></li><li><p><span>深圳搞钱必备社交技能——用玄学夸客户，破冰效果奇佳。</span></p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【周易科普时间】</span></strong><span> 八字是什么？身强身弱怎么看？以及那个精妙的比喻：</span><strong><span>“八字是你开的车，流年运势是你走的路。豪车走烂路也难受，破车走高速也舒服。”</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>DeepSeek算命水平？</span></strong><span> </span></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span>Part 2：西方神秘 - 星座、星宿与塔罗</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>星座吐槽大会：</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2927">48:47</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【星宿关系科普】</span></strong><span> </span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3318">55:18</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【塔罗牌科普 by 木木】</span></strong></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span>Part 3：赛博玄学 - MBTI与最终理性讨论</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4133">01:08:53</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>MBTI：</span></strong><span> 从星座手中接过了社交货币的接力棒。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4212">01:10:12</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>主播MBTI大公开</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5133">01:25:33</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>灵魂拷问（测你是S人还是N人）：</span></strong><span> “如果一匹马走进酒吧，他会对酒保说什么？”</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5605">01:33:25</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【理性讨论环节】</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>为什么玄学越来越火？</span></strong><span> </span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>玄学 vs 心理学？</span></strong><span> </span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong><span>🎬 结尾</span></strong></h3><blockquote><p><span>“真正的运势，藏在你的选择和行动里。”</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>下期预告？</span></strong><span> 还没想好，但我们会继续 lay back。</span></p><p><strong><span>本期免责声明：</span></strong><span> 内容纯属娱乐，不构成任何决策依据。请理性看待，快乐生活。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f6d2a46c7f817786935a59/lre-w5d5fR1AP-XntHfcljYDi6Ti.m4a" length="99822151" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:42:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLW5WxKGki1AIG8rYMfwVgTGNxE.JPG"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 让我们走近科学之：消失的黄鼠狼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696cc06f109824f9e1235b25</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696cc06f109824f9e1235b25</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 11:22:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期简介：</span></strong><br><span>在（迟到三个月的）万圣节氛围中，让我们开启了一场关于“灵异事件”的闲聊。从童年阴影般的鬼片观影体验，到《今日说法》《走近科学》带来的另类恐惧；从成都“第一鬼楼”、哈尔滨猫脸老太太到北京“最强钉子户”北顶娘娘庙等都市传说；再到亲身经历的“黄大仙”入户、童年“喊魂”等玄学事件……本期节目既有背脊发凉的瞬间，也有让人忍俊不禁的“走近科学”式结局。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线目录：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a></span></strong><span> 话题一：童年鬼片观影“阴影”与趣事</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a></span></strong><span> 话题二：那些年看过的《今日说法》与《走近科学》</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a></span></strong><span> 话题三：各地都市传说大赏</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a></span></strong><span> 话题四：亲身经历的“灵异”与玄学事件</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3201">53:21</a></span></strong><span> 话题五：对抗恐惧的私人方法</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f6d2a46c7f817786935a59/lvFIkN5qDGpQmIpaXcFgRbTR5wA4.m4a" length="57838133" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqm8zc864LHdbmQWSSw8x8KDTHUP.png"/>
