    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Aug 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><strong><span>《火锅炖大鹅》亚冬会特辑：冰雪热血与人间真实</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><span>各位同担大家好，好久不见，本期是我们的特别夏日纳凉特辑，本期内容我们请来了两位嘉宾，分别是前短道速滑运动员小红和花滑粉丝花花！在这期内容里我们会进行在今年年初举行的亚冬会相关赛事回顾，以及冰雪运动背后的小秘密的解密。如果对我们的节目感兴趣或者有想参与讨论的欢迎在评论区留言，我们会积极回复（媚粉）的。</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a></span></strong><span> 【片头】危险发言安全区</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>-</span></strong><span>好久不见的打招呼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">2:33</a>-</span></strong><span>亚冬记忆</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>「韩国男队为免兵役变疯批！」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>「IFS商场看接力夺冠社死」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>「</span><strong><span>全市懵：亚冬会是啥？」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>「修车师傅过年被迫值班」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>-</span></strong><span>赛场黑皮书</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>赛道机密：</span><br><span>→ </span><strong><span>「绝不自己数圈！靠裁判翻牌+摇铃」</span></strong><br><span>→ </span><strong><span>「冰球选手=行走的鲱鱼罐头+毁冰狂魔」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>「索契亲冰面：从韩国弃子到俄籍3金王」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a>-</span></strong><span>冰雪入坑劝退指南</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>滑雪钱包刺客</span><br><span>→ 账单解剖：</span><br><span>雪鞋￥2000 | 头盔￥1000（</span><em><span>保命刚需</span></em><span>）</span><br><span>隐形税：骨科医药费+误工费</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>花滑人间清醒 → </span><strong><span>「咸鱼30元冰票体验，百万爬藤专业路」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a>-</span></strong><span>冷门真香定律</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>颜值暴言&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冰壶叛逆安利 → </span><strong><span>「团队协作=集体擦地艺术」</span></strong><br><span>→ 作打假：</span><strong><span>「靠腿发力！别用手扔！」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a>-</span></strong><span>运动圈潜规则</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>中产滑雪韭菜实录 → </span><strong><span>「沉默成本困局：放弃亏5万，继续亏未知」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>装备阶级链 → </span><strong><span>「速滑定制鞋￥1万 vs 学生党球刀￥200」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>冰球男祛魅 → </span><strong><span>「双开门冰箱→下冰后人间毒气弹」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3331">55:31</a>-</span></strong><span>下期预告</span></p>]]></description>
